              "text": "criticar — \"to criticise\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "No me gusta criticar a la gente. I do not like criticising people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Spelling: critiqué in the past, critique in the subjunctive."
